  "name": "mina-state-proof",
  "description": "An In-EVM verification framework for Mina Protocol state and account proofs, enabling trustless cross-chain interoperability on Ethereum. The system utilizes the Placeholder proof system—a PLONK-based SNARK—implemented as a series of Solidity verifier contracts for various arithmetic gates and commitment schemes. It provides a complete Hardhat-based development environment for deploying verifiers, validating ledger state proofs, and verifying account-specific Merkle paths within the EVM.",
